SUMMARY:Information Session for University of Wolverhampton Nigerian Applicants 2023
UID:b97kuj9o74rjidpi6goj6e1nf5456k2dat3ncl228csnaki8btancgipcljg
TZID:Europe/London
DESCRIPTION:Join from a PC\, Mac\, iPad\, iPhone or Android device:\n    Please click this URL to join. https://us02web.zoom.us/w/89797241387?tk=wlwP-l-rcvdKT5Oh-TZE77pYAElnJzBMnh_YL8nCHqQ.DQMAAAAU6FUqKxZ5SFNQTVdHdlRCQzl1UkhfVXZCWWVnAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\n	Description: Dear Applicant\,\n\nYou are invited to these sessions as you have applied to further your studies here at the University of Wolverhampton starting in September 2023. During these sessions you will be able to understand better how to ensure you meet the deadlines and apply for your visa. The topics covered will include: \n\n-	The application and admissions process\n-	Documents for an Unconditional offer\n-	Using an education agency\n-	Paying your tuition fee\n-	Documents needed for CAS\n-	Applying for your visa\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you on a weekly basis as this will be an informative session that will support you in gaining admission to the University of Wolverhampton\n\nOr One tap mobile:\n    +441314601196\,\,89797241387# United Kingdom\n    +442034815237\,\,89797241387# United Kingdom\n\nOr join by phone:\n    Dial(for higher quality\, dial a number based on your current location):\n        United Kingdom: +44 131 460 1196  or +44 203 481 5237  or +44 203 481 5240  or +44 203 901 7895  or +44 208 080 6591  or +44 208 080 6592  or +44 330 088 5830 \n        US: +1 305 224 1968  or +1 309 205 3325  or +1 312 626 6799  or +1 346 248 7799  or +1 360 209 5623  or +1 386 347 5053  or +1 507 473 4847  or +1 564 217 2000  or +1 646 558 8656  or +1 646 931 3860  or +1 669 444 9171  or +1 669 900 9128  or +1 689 278 1000  or +1 719 359 4580  or +1 253 205 0468  or +1 253 215 8782  or +1 301 715 8592 \n    Webinar ID: 897 9724 1387\n    International numbers available: https://us02web.zoom.us/u/kcQSfCM6SM\n\n
LOCATION:https://us02web.zoom.us/w/89797241387?tk=wlwP-l-rcvdKT5Oh-TZE77pYAElnJzBMnh_YL8nCHqQ.DQMAAAAU6FUqKxZ5SFNQTVdHdlRCQzl1UkhfVXZCWWVnAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA
